{"text": " You wake up in 1807 on Paul Mall in London. It's a warm June evening and a crowd is staring at a row of iron posts. Did you know that the first gas lights on a London street were lit for the King's birthday? A German-born businessman named Fredricich Windsor Burns Gas made from coal, piped along the street, no wick, no wax. Here's your evening, the shops stay open after dark. Mill owners start to see something new, a factory that never has to stop at sunset. Five years later, in 1812, Parliament grants a charter to the Gas Light and Co-Company, the first gas company in the world. Light runs under the street to your door and arrives with a bill. So what is light now, a service? It comes to you through a pipe. But across the ocean, the best light in America still comes from the head of a whale.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.68, "text": " You wake up in 1807 on Paul Mall in London.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 11971, 22, 322, 4552, 24883, 294, 7042, 13, 50596], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16428791108678598, "compression_ratio": 1.5090252707581226, "no_speech_prob": 0.007420120295137167, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "probability": 0.8051379919052124}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.3, "probability": 0.9878683090209961}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.54, "probability": 0.9993176460266113}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.54, "end": 0.78, "probability": 0.9959397315979004}, {"word": " 1807", "start": 0.78, "end": 1.82, "probability": 0.9582528471946716}, {"word": " on", "start": 1.82, "end": 2.56, "probability": 0.9033255577087402}, {"word": " Paul", "start": 2.56, "end": 2.88, "probability": 0.64972984790802}, {"word": " Mall", "start": 2.88, "end": 3.1, "probability": 0.6215372085571289}, {"word": " in", "start": 3.1, "end": 3.42, "probability": 0.9412743449211121}, {"word": " London.", "start": 3.42, "end": 3.68, "probability": 0.9917308688163757}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 